{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/Descripci\u00f3n_Wishlist_-_600x132_Ingl\u00e9s.png?t=1744692827\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/001.png?t=1744692827\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Amid endless cornfields and the echo of an unsettling silence lies a farm where something feels off. Here, the wind carries more than leaves; it carries questions no one dares to answer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/001.gif?t=1744692827\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Julio, a young man who never wanted to return to the countryside, arrives seeking answers about his grandfather. But as night falls, the solitude of this place starts to feel like a lie. There\u2019s something in the shadows, something watching, something waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/RUN.gif?t=1744692827\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>As you explore, the familiarity of the surroundings transforms into a maze of uncertainty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/House_Explore.gif?t=1744692827\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Every sound, every shadow seems designed to remind you that you\u2019re not alone. The unknown surrounds you\u2014unseen but tangible\u2014playing with your senses and challenging your perception of reality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/Drink.gif?t=1744692827\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In The Harvest, terror doesn\u2019t impose itself; it whispers. It\u2019s a murmur in the wind, a figure that vanishes when you turn your head. What you uncover will change not only Julio\u2019s life but your understanding of what it means to be watched.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who\u2019s really harvesting?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Psychological horror</strong>, emphasizing atmosphere, tension, and a constant sense of dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-person exploration</strong>, designed to fully immerse you in the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A deep, linear narrative</strong>, with unexpected twists that linger long after the credits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Photorealistic visuals</strong>, maximizing immersion with every detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A detailed soundscape</strong>, turning silence and noise into instruments of fear.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3388330?t=1744692827","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/2f42c4011134ea6c070283a762effbd8868a6cbe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744692827","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/7a5c02b846e5b09cdd9c4c531573ff18bff059fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744692827","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/7a5c02b846e5b09cdd9c4c531573ff18bff059fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744692827","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/