ishes when you turn your head. What you uncover will change not only Julio\u2019s life but your understanding of what it means to be watched.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who\u2019s really harvesting?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Psychological horror</strong>, emphasizing atmosphere, tension, and a constant sense of dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-person exploration</strong>, designed to fully immerse you in the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A deep, linear narrative</strong>, with unexpected twists that linger long after the credits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Photorealistic visuals</strong>, maximizing immersion with every detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A detailed soundscape</strong>, turning silence and noise into instruments of fear.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Glintle Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/e6cbd678dbe77d0adaaa28a3684ead8817e2b6e8/header.jpg?t=1744692827","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Untold Chronicles: The Harvest","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 1500x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><