_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/705adf540bc00587b70cbb8f20a414763d921098/ss_705adf540bc00587b70cbb8f20a414763d921098.600x338.jpg?t=1744692827"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/ss_cc771084333b59d427552a2f3b8015bcd579de0b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744692827","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/ss_cc771084333b59d427552a2f3b8015bcd579de0b.600x338.jpg?t=1744692827"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/ss_b81ad7d0c5547f5bc2efa9f61cde930fd581d074.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744692827","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/ss_b81ad7d0c5547f5bc2efa9f61cde930fd581d074.600x338.jpg?t=1744692827"}],"short_description":"In this field, what is harvested doesn\u2019t sprout from the earth. Something hides among the cornfields, watching all the time. Explore and dare to see what the earth itself tries to conceal\u2026 because this time, you are part of the harvest.","steam_appid":3388330,"support_info":{"email":"glintlestudios@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}